\par 
\par How to open and install your Black NXT program:
\par 
\par - Open the Black NXT}{\f1\fs20\insrsid6901071  program}{\f1\fs20\insrsid2890393  folder with the 19 ric-files and the NXT-G program 'BlackNxt.rbt'.
\par 
\par - Copy all 19 ric-files and place in this folder on your computer: C:\\Program Files\\LEGO Software\\LEGO MINDSTORMS NXT\\engine\\Pictures
\par 
\par - open the NXT-G program 'BlackNxt.rbt'. Your NXT software should automatically load with this program.
\par 
\par - the program will have a display block that will load the 19 ric-files.
\par 
\par - download the program to your black NXT and run it.
\par 
\par - click the right button on the NXT and watch the display to see your exclusive program!
